  "summary": [
    "Numbers from 21 to 99 put the unit first: Einer + und + Zehner, written as one word (vierundzwanzig).",
    "The tens: zwanzig, dreißig, vierzig, fünfzig, sechzig, siebzig, achtzig, neunzig, hundert.",
    "Exceptions: sechzig and siebzig lose letters; dreißig is spelled with ß; eins becomes ein- in compounds.",
    "Ask age with Wie alt sind Sie? / Wie alt bist du? and answer Ich bin ... Jahre alt."
